# gitleaks ignore list for AA-CIS-Infra (AA-841): one finding fingerprint per line, for a single
# known false positive that a narrow allowlist entry in .gitleaks.toml cannot express.
#
# Fingerprint format (printed by gitleaks with --redact, never the secret itself):
#   PR / history scan:  <commit sha>:<file>:<rule id>:<line>
#   working-tree scan:  <file>:<rule id>:<line>
# Add a short comment above each entry: what the value is and why it is not a secret.
# A real secret is never ignored here: remove it from the PR and rotate it instead.
